OL,3,GNEWSA'Upset' at plans to close hospital
OL,4,Ahydrotherapy pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients said the closure of a
OL,7,Fhospital's hydrotherapy pool has left
OL,8,Fthem feeling "disgusted" and "upset".
OL,10,FHealth bosses have decided to shut the
OL,11,Fpool at King's Mill Hospital in
OL,12,FSutton-in-Ashfield, Nottinghamshire,
OL,13,Fand offer "land-based therapies".
OL,15,FSherwood Forest Hospitals NHS
OL,16,FFoundation Trust said this had been
OL,17,Fdone as it tries to save #35m and
OL,18,Freviews the services it offers.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
