OL,3,GNEWSA'Upset' at plans to close hospital
OL,4,Ahydrotherapy pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut thousands of residents have called
OL,7,Fon the hospital to find a way to keep
OL,8,Fit open and two MPs have spoken to the
OL,9,Fhospital leadership about the decision.
